---
// Bento Grid showcasing pyscriptc platform features
---

<section class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 lg:py-28 text-left" id="features">
  <!-- Section Header (Option 4) -->
  <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.12] mb-4">
      Built for production systems.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-400 font-light leading-relaxed">
      Single-command compilation across architectures with no per-target sysroot or SDK setup (zig cc does the linking), pure package support, and documented, numbered divergences.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Bento Grid Container -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-5 sm:gap-6">
    <!-- Card 1: Deploy Anywhere (Large Hero Bento Card - 7 Cols) -->
    <div
      class="lg:col-span-7 rounded-2xl bg-[#0b0f19]/80 hover:bg-[#0b0f19] border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 relative overflow-hidden group"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="mb-5">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400">
            <!-- Package / Works Anywhere Box Icon -->
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="2" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z" />
              <polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96" />
              <line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12" />
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight mb-2">
          Deploy Anywhere
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Single-command cross-compilation for any cloud or desktop platform.
          No per-target sysroot or SDK setup.
        </p>

        <!-- Platform Targets List -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="2">
                <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2" />
                <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21" />
                <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">Linux</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-light">x86_64, aarch64 · glibc &amp; musl</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="2">
                <rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2" />
                <line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">macOS</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-light">aarch64 (Apple Silicon) &amp; x86_64 · Mach-O</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Command Snippet Footer -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-[#06080d] border border-white/5 text-slate-300">
        <span class="text-slate-500 font-bold">$</span>
        <span>pyscriptc compile app.py --target=aarch64-linux</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: PyPI Package Support (5 Cols) -->
    <div
      class="lg:col-span-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#0b0f19]/80 hover:bg-[#0b0f19] border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 group"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="mb-5">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400">
            <!-- Layers / PyPI Box Icon -->
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="2">
              <polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2" />
              <polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17" />
              <polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12" />
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight mb-2">
          PyPI Package Support
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Compile pure Python packages directly into machine code. Eliminate virtualenv setup,
          wheel build-matrix hurdles, and runtime dependency bloat in production containers.
          Top-100 PyPI packages are tracked nightly against the pinned suite; the live
          breakdown lives on the compatibility site.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="text-slate-400 mb-1.5 text-[11px]">
          Pure Python package acceleration
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-1">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-300">certifi</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-300">tzdata</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/5 text-[11px] text-slate-400">18 pinned top-100 packages, tracked nightly</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3: Programmatic & CLI API (5 Cols) -->
    <div
      class="lg:col-span-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#0b0f19]/80 hover:bg-[#0b0f19] border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 group"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="mb-5">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400">
            <!-- Code / Terminal API Icon -->
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="2">
              <polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6" />
              <polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18" />
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight mb-2">
          CLI-First Compiler
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Control the compiler from the terminal or automate inside CI scripts.
          Full access to IR stages, LLVM output, and diagnostic codes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#08090d] border border-white/5 p-3.5 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300">
        <div class="text-slate-500 mb-1"># CLI emits ir, llvm, asm, obj, bin, lib, binding</div>
        <div>pyscriptc compile service.py --emit=<span class="text-slate-200">bin</span> --target=<span class="text-slate-200">aarch64-linux</span> -O3</div>
        <div><span class="text-slate-500"># explain any diagnostic code:</span> <span class="text-cyan-400">pyscriptc explain</span> <span class="text-slate-200">PS2002</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#06080d] border border-white/5 p-3.5 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300">
        <div class="text-slate-500 mb-1"># check a program against the CPython oracle</div>
        <div><span class="text-cyan-400">pyscriptc verify</span> <span class="text-slate-200">service.py</span></div>
        <div><span class="text-slate-500"># list every import and the lane it takes</span></div>
        <div><span class="text-cyan-400">pyscriptc imports</span> <span class="text-slate-200">service.py</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 4: C-ABI Shared Libraries (Planned) (7 Cols) -->
    <div
      class="lg:col-span-7 rounded-2xl bg-[#0b0f19]/80 hover:bg-[#0b0f19] border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 group"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="mb-5">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400">
            <!-- Plug / Link / C ABI Icon -->
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="2">
              <path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71" />
              <path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71" />
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight mb-2">
          Shared Libraries &amp; Headers
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">
          <code class="font-mono text-slate-300">--emit binding</code> compiles a typed module into a
          shared library (<code class="font-mono text-slate-300">.so</code>, <code class="font-mono text-slate-300">.dylib</code>, <code class="font-mono text-slate-300">.dll</code>)
          plus a ctypes loader, so CPython calls your typed functions without
          <code class="font-mono text-slate-300">Python.h</code> or an extension build.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5">
          <span class="text-white font-semibold block mb-0.5">ctypes Loader</span>
          <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">A <code class="text-slate-300">.py</code> loader that opens the library with <code class="text-slate-300">ctypes.CDLL</code>.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5">
          <span class="text-white font-semibold block mb-0.5">Static Library &amp; Headers</span>
          <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]"><code class="text-slate-300">--emit lib</code> emits <code class="text-slate-300">libpyscriptc.a</code>, <code class="text-slate-300">pyscriptc.h</code> and a module map.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 5: CPython 3.14 Parity (6 Cols) -->
    <div
      class="lg:col-span-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#0b0f19]/80 hover:bg-[#0b0f19] border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 group"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="mb-5">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400">
            <!-- Shield / Parity Checkmark Icon -->
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="2">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
              <polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10" />
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight mb-2">
          CPython 3.14 Parity
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
          CPython 3.14.9 semantics for the supported subset. Write idiomatic standard Python:
          pattern matching, standard exception handling and generator expressions compile into
          native machine instructions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-slate-400 pt-2 border-t border-white/5">
        <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">✓</span>
        <span>Validated against a frozen CPython 3.14 oracle corpus; numbered divergences documented</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 6: Strict Type Diagnostics & Verification (6 Cols) -->
    <div
      class="lg:col-span-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#0b0f19]/80 hover:bg-[#0b0f19] border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 group"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="mb-5">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400">
            <!-- Diagnostic Radar / Target Icon -->
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6" />
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight mb-2">
          Compile-Time Diagnostics
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Deep static type verification and fence boundary checks. Identifies type instability, unboxed scalar leaks,
          and dynamic fallback barriers before your binary reaches production servers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-slate-400 pt-2 border-t border-white/5">
        <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">✓</span>
        <span>Deterministic execution: First-iteration speed equals 1,000,000th iteration speed</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
